package ships its upstream licence text under <prefix>/doc/<tool>/, and each
package.sh pins the exact upstream source (URL + sha256) beside the patches
in its directory; together they are the corresponding source of the
published binaries.

Built binaries link the startup objects and the shared libc of the stock Amiga
UNIX (Amix) SVR4 system. On 2026-09-23 Amiga Corporation approved the
distribution of the Commodore Amiga binaries that this project builds on.

